{
  "name": "api-client-sdk",
  "description": "Build a client SDK from an OpenAPI spec end to end: Spectral lint and readiness rules, inventory, generator decision, type mapping, stack-specific generation (python, typescript, go), coverage audit, auth, timeouts, retries, idempotency, pagination, errors, typed responses, mock and contract tests, fault injection, versioning and usage docs.",
